{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09488","headline":"汉武帝杂歌三首 三 · 韦应物","name":"汉武帝杂歌三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉天子，观风自南国。\n浮舟大江屹不前，蛟龙索鬬风波黑。\n春秋方壮雄武才，弯弧叱浪连山开。\n愕然观者千万衆，举麾齐呼一矢中。\n死蛟浮出不复灵，舳舻千里江水清。\n鼓颦余响数日在，天吴深入鱼鼈惊。\n左有佽飞落霜翮，右有孤儿贯犀革。\n何爲临深亲射蛟，示威以夺诸侯魄。\n威可畏，皇可尊，平田校猎书犹陈。\n此日从臣何不言，独有威声振千古，君不见後嗣尊爲武。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}